@format 1
@id ui-event.quality-readout-key-down
@title Quality readout — key down
@section I. UI
@area UI event
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge
@event-ref cs|PSShared/PSField.cs|PSFieldSliderBuild|pReadout|KeyDown|1
@entry input
@summary Commit a manually entered ranged quality value when Enter is pressed.
@tag key down
@tag PSField
@alias owner = Cadroue.UIShell.PSShared.PSField

[input] UI event <input>
- Receive the key down event from the quality readout @ owner.PSFieldSliderBuild
> key

[key] Check commit key <decision>
- Check whether the pressed key is Enter @ owner.PSFieldSliderBuild
? "Enter" > commit
? "Another key" > edit

[commit] Normalize manual quality <process>
- Parse, clamp, snap, and format the typed quality while synchronizing the slider @ owner.PSFieldSliderBuild
> output

[edit] Preserve intermediate text <output>
= The user can continue editing incomplete text.

[output] Quality committed <output>
= The normalized value is displayed and represented by the slider.
! Code binding: cs|PSShared/PSField.cs|PSFieldSliderBuild|pReadout|KeyDown|1
